Major modifications in this distribution include:
  - responsive account, settings, product, order and skill-center interfaces;
  - product-scoped AI knowledge, training rules and conversation testing;
  - typed and masked settings APIs with atomic section saves;
  - QR secondary-verification browser session handling;
  - truthful skill capability reporting and operational diagnostics;
  - removal of sensitive values from runtime logs and public exports.

